# Tablet of Discovery's restricted {R}{R} empties from the pool as the step ends (CR 106.4), like any mana. It is tapped in
# the first main phase and floats there: the Lightning Bolt in hand could be cast with it (the positive control, checked
# by the pool still holding it). In the second main phase the pool is empty and, with no other mana, the Bolt cannot be cast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Tablet of Discovery
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#3.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tablet of Discovery.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Tablet of Discovery.Activate(Ability: Spend)
? Bot1.Mana = {R}{R} (InstantOrSorcerySpells)
Bot1.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Mana =
! Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Lightning Bolt; Island; Island
